   "title": "Awari Unveils Next Chapter as a Lifestyle Technology Platform at Business Connect 2026",
   "url": "https://www.thisdaylive.com/2026/10/20/awari-unveils-next-chapter-as-a-lifestyle-technology-platform-at-business-connect-2026/",
   "domain": "thisdaylive.com",
